There are a few admittedly esoteric cases where a scroll of fire is useful.
The scroll does fire damage to adjacent squares.  This is useful when you want
to hurt something without "attacking" it and possibly upsetting some god.  If 
you have fire resistance, all the better.  A particularly useful situation is
when you are trapped between a nurse and a nasty monster.  You don't want to
take off your armor or attack the nurse.  Read the scroll and oops, fried 
nurse.  The gods don't care, and you can continue to bash away at the bad
